{"seq":28,"slug":"garbage-collection-memory","title":"垃圾回收与内存管理","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory","rating":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 垃圾回收与内存管理\n\n程序运行时分配的每一块内存，迟早都要还回去。谁来还、何时还、怎么还——这三个问题分出了 C 与 Java、Rust 与 Go 的根本气质，也决定了一个服务在百万 QPS 下是平稳如水还是周期性卡顿。这个 hub 把「内存管理」拆成四层来讲，每一层都建立在前一层的概念之上，读完你会拥有一张从硬件地址空间一路通到生产环境 GC 调优的完整地图。\n\n第一章「基础」先把舞台搭起来。我们从进程的虚拟地址空间讲起，区分栈与堆这两种生命周期截然不同的内存，看分配器如何在堆上切出一块块空间、又如何被碎片困扰；接着对比手动管理与自动回收这两条历史路线各自的代价；最后给出贯穿全 hub 的核心判据——可达性：一个对象是不是垃圾，取决于它能否从根集合被触达。这三篇为后面所有算法提供了共同词汇。\n\n第二章「核心算法」是整个 hub 的引擎室。引用计数用每个对象的计数器换来即时回收与确定性析构，却被循环引用绊住脚；标记-清除沿着可达性把活对象标出来、把死对象扫掉，标记-整理再额外搬动对象消除碎片；复制算法用空间换时间，分代回收则押注「绝大多数对象朝生夕死」这条经验假设，把堆切成新生代与老年代分而治之。这三类算法是后面所有工业级收集器的零件库。\n\n第三章「高级收集器」走进现代运行时的真实战场。要把动辄数十毫秒的「停顿世界」压到亚毫秒，就必须让回收线程和应用线程并发跑，这引出了写屏障、SATB、增量更新等一整套并发正确性机制；分区式收集器 G1、ZGC、Shenandoah 把堆切成大量小区，配合染色指针与读屏障实现与堆大小无关的低停顿；逃逸分析与 TLAB 则从另一端发力——让很多对象根本不必进堆、也不必被回收。\n\n第四章「实践与调优」把前三章的原理落到键盘上。我们讲怎么读 GC 日志、盯哪些指标，怎么在延迟与吞吐这对天然矛盾之间做取舍并选对收集器，以及当内存只增不减时如何用堆转储与采样式 profiler 揪出泄漏的真凶。四章一路从「内存是什么」走到「线上为什么 OOM」，原理与手感在这里合流。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"memory-model-allocation","title":"内存模型与分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/foundations/memory-model-allocation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"manual-vs-automatic","title":"手动管理与自动回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/foundations/manual-vs-automatic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reachability-roots","title":"可达性与根集合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/foundations/reachability-roots"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-algorithms","title":"核心算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/core-algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reference-counting","title":"引用计数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/core-algorithms/reference-counting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mark-sweep-compact","title":"标记-清除与标记-整理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/core-algorithms/mark-sweep-compact"},{"seq":3,"slug":"copying-generational","title":"复制与分代回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/core-algorithms/copying-generational"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced-collectors","title":"高级收集器","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/advanced-collectors","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"concurrent-incremental","title":"并发与增量回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/advanced-collectors/concurrent-incremental"},{"seq":2,"slug":"region-based-g1-zgc","title":"分区式收集器 G1/ZGC/Shenandoah","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/advanced-collectors/region-based-g1-zgc"},{"seq":3,"slug":"escape-analysis-tlab","title":"逃逸分析与 TLAB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/advanced-collectors/escape-analysis-tlab"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice-tuning","title":"实践与调优","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/practice-tuning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gc-tuning-metrics","title":"GC 调优与指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/practice-tuning/gc-tuning-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-throughput-tradeoffs","title":"延迟与吞吐权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/practice-tuning/latency-throughput-tradeoffs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"leaks-diagnostics","title":"内存泄漏与诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/garbage-collection-memory/practice-tuning/leaks-diagnostics"}]}]}